- The RFP states: **“Prospective Consultants must submit seven (7) complete printed copies of their Proposal, and one electronic version.”**
- Section V also states: **“Submit seven (7) printed copies of your Proposal in a sealed package and one (1) version electronically.”**

## Additional Detail
- **One printed copy** must be labeled **“Master Copy”** and include **original signatures**.
